          human: 'Chinese Poker (also known as Pusoy, Russian Poker, or 13 Cards) is a card game where players arrange 13 cards into three poker hands (back, middle, front) that must increase in strength. Players compare hands against each other to win units. Popular in Hong Kong, Southeast Asia, and the USA.',
